  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Startup Investment and Ecosystem Enhancement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Strategic investment in ESG aligned SMEs and matching fund collaboration 2. Localized acceleration and early-stage mentoring. 3. Identification and support for PoC opportunity</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the growth foundation of small and medium-sized enterprises in Vietnam and enhance local collaboration aligned with Lotte Group ESG strategy. It provides comprehensive support centered on investment and proof-of-concept collaboration for SMEs facing challenges in financing, technological capabilities, and market access. Ultimately, the project is expected to contribute to local job creation and economic revitalization while also supporting Lotte Group sustainable business growth, as the development of SMEs and local communities may lead to the expansion of Lotte consumer-oriented business in Vietnam.&#xbca0;&#xd2b8;&#xb0a8; &#xc2a4;&#xd0c0;&#xd2b8;&#xc5c5;&#xc758; &#xc7ac;&#xc6d0; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xac1c;&#xc120;, &#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xbaa8;&#xb378; &#xace0;&#xb3c4;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc2a4;&#xd0c0;&#xd2b8;&#xc5c5; &#xc131;&#xc7a5;, &#xbca0;&#xd2b8;&#xb0a8; &#xc2a4;&#xd0c0;&#xd2b8;&#xc5c5; &#xd22c;&#xc790; &#xc0dd;&#xd0dc;&#xacc4; &#xd65c;&#xc131;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
